The integer reference models in this repository were checked against upstream commit de7d773.

Only the seven files needed to build EfficientViT-Seg-B1 are kept:
  models/efficientvit/backbone.py, models/efficientvit/seg.py,
  models/nn/act.py, models/nn/norm.py, models/nn/ops.py,
  models/utils/list.py, models/utils/network.py
plus the package __init__.py files.

Modifications:
  - models/efficientvit/__init__.py, models/nn/__init__.py, models/utils/__init__.py:
    import only the modules listed above.
  - models/nn/norm.py: the Triton RMSNorm kernel (triton_rms_norm.py, not included) is
    imported inside TritonRMSNorm2d.forward instead of at module level. EfficientViT-Seg-B1
    does not use that layer.
All other kept files are unchanged.
